# November 24, 2026: Lawrence, Eudora, Baldwin City and Lecompton, Douglas County, Kansas. A third pass over the county, taking
# Register listings the earlier batches (ks_kwud, ks_pmvt, ks_dgmn) lack: the Kansas University halls, houses and churches in
# Lawrence, its old industrial and downtown buildings, and one building each in Eudora, Baldwin City and Lecompton.
# Sources: the Kansas Historical Society's Register summaries (read with page.py), National Register forms from NPGallery
# where they have text, Wikipedia (wiki_raw.py), and web search results for what a building is used for now. Coordinates are
# street-address points from the ArcGIS geocoder. Nothing seen on the ground.
from data_b import N
